---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Base title="Resources | Impact Collective">
  <Header />

  <!-- Hero banner: full-bleed, lavender behind -->
  <section class="w-full" style="background-color: var(--color-bg-lavender);">
    <img
      src="/images/venture-banner.jpg"
      alt="Give a hand up, not a hand out"
      class="resources-hero"
    />
  </section>

  <section id="main-content" class="w-full" style="background-color: var(--color-bg-white);">
    <div class="resources-container">

      <!-- Learning Kit — Image LEFT, Text RIGHT -->
      <div class="resources-row resources-row--kit">
        <img
          src="/images/resources-learning-kit.png"
          alt="Learning Kit"
          width="260"
          height="331"
          class="resources-img"
          style="width: 260px; height: 331px;"
        />
        <div class="resources-text" style="max-width: 445px;">
          <h2 class="resources-title">Learning Kit</h2>
          <p class="resources-body resources-body--loose">
            Microfinance is a way to provide small loans, insurance, and other financial services to people who don't have access to traditional banks. This includes low-income individuals, struggling entrepreneurs, and small business owners who need a little financial boost to grow, start a business, or improve their communities.
          </p>
          <p class="resources-body resources-body--loose">
            PD Microfinance explains it simply with their curated training kit for beginners. <a href="/docs/education-training.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="resources-link">Click</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="resources-divider" />

      <!-- Workshops — title band between two dividers -->
      <div class="resources-band">
        <h2 class="resources-title" style="margin-bottom: 0;">Workshops</h2>
      </div>

      <hr class="resources-divider" />

      <!-- Workshops — Text LEFT, Image RIGHT -->
      <div class="resources-row resources-row--workshops">
        <div class="resources-text" style="max-width: 450px;">
          <p class="resources-body">
            For a sustainable microfinance chapter, relying solely on one-time donations and occasional fundraisers is not enough. PD Microfinance's success—consistently ranking #1 among new high school chapters on Kiva for the past two years—has been driven by a student-run business, Frostbite's Frozen Ice.
          </p>
          <p class="resources-body">
            As a private LLC. it sells snow cones at school events, community fairs, the Festival of India, and other local gatherings, generating a steady source of funding for microloans.
          </p>
          <p class="resources-body">
            If you're interested in starting a student business but aren't sure where to begin, check out our playbook for a step-by-step guide. <a href="/start-a-chapter" class="resources-link">Click</a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <img
          src="/images/resources-workshops.jpg"
          alt="Frostbite's Frozen Ice"
          width="438"
          height="377"
          class="resources-img"
          style="width: 438px; height: 377px; object-fit: cover;"
        />
      </div>

      <hr class="resources-divider" />

      <!-- Lend Ledger — Text LEFT, Image RIGHT -->
      <div class="resources-row resources-row--ledger">
        <div class="resources-text" style="max-width: 402px;">
          <h2 class="resources-title" style="margin-bottom: 36px;">Lend Ledger</h2>
          <p class="resources-body">
            Lend Ledger is a free app built for student-run Kiva lending chapters. It connects to your Kiva team to pull live lending stats, and gives you a simple ledger to log revenue from your ventures, track how much goes toward microloans, and monitor your chapter's overall impact.
          </p>
          <p class="resources-body">
            No spreadsheets, no accounting software, no setup fee. Just download the file, enter your Kiva team ID, and the app configures itself around your chapter in under a minute.
          </p>
          <p class="resources-body">
            Download Lend Ledger and the User Manual below to get started.
          </p>
          <a href="/lend-ledger" class="resources-button">Check it out</a>
        </div>
        <img
          src="/images/resources-lend-ledger.jpg"
          alt="Smartphone Analytics View"
          width="402"
          height="302"
          class="resources-img"
          style="width: 402px; height: 302px; object-fit: cover; margin-top: 28px;"
        />
      </div>

      <hr class="resources-divider" style="margin-bottom: 0;" />

    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .resources-hero {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 446px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .resources-container {
    max-width: 1012px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 125px 16px 46px;
  }

  .resources-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  /* Offsets mirror the Wix layout inside its 980px column */
  .resources-row--kit {
    padding-left: 111px;
    gap: 73px;
    margin-bottom: 121px;
  }

  .resources-band {
    padding: 20px 0 176px 145px;
  }

  .resources-row--workshops {
    padding: 25px 26px 48px 37px;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .resources-row--workshops .resources-text {
    padding-top: 28px;
  }

  .resources-row--ledger {
    padding: 40px 46px 35px 32px;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .resources-img {
    display: block;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .resources-text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .resources-title {
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 35px;
    color: #000000;
    margin-bottom: 21px;
  }

  .resources-body {
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.16px;
    color: #000000;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .resources-body--loose {
    line-height: 28.8px;
    margin-bottom: 29px;
  }

  .resources-link {
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: rgb(56, 74, 211);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .resources-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 270px;
    height: 45px;
    margin: 29px 0 0 30px;
    background: #3f7652;
    color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .resources-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid #000000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .resources-hero {
      height: 220px;
    }

    .resources-container {
      padding-top: 48px;
    }

    .resources-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
      padding-left: 0;
      padding-right: 0;
    }

    .resources-row--kit {
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .resources-band {
      padding: 20px 0 40px;
    }

    .resources-button {
      margin-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
